              "level": 0,
              "text": "Skin biopsies show dermal thickening,",
              "pdf_page": 1032,
              "printed_page": 950,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "Prognosis is guarded to grave. myxedema, and vacuolation of arrector pili",
              "pdf_page": 1032,
              "printed_page": 950,
              "column": 2
            },
            {
              "type": "bullet",
              "level": 0,
              "text": "If patient survives initial treatment, treat and muscles. monitor as recommended for hypothyroidism.",
